Caption: Fig. 2.74. Schematic illustration of the equiaxed, columnar and single-crystal structures used for turbine blade aerofoils.
Description: Schematic diagrams labeled (a), (b), and (c) illustrating different crystal structures for turbine blade aerofoils. Diagram (a) shows an equiaxed structure with randomly oriented grains. Diagram (b) displays a columnar structure with vertically elongated grains. Diagram (c) depicts a single-crystal structure. An inset shows the orientation of the cube axes.
