Caption: Fig. 3.28. Scanning electron micrograph of the γ/γ' microstructure of the CMSX-4 single-crystal superalloy. (Courtesy of Nirundorn Matan.)
Description: This is a scanning electron micrograph showing the γ/γ' microstructure of the CMSX-4 superalloy. It displays a regular array of cuboidal γ' precipitates (lighter gray, blocky shapes) separated by a network of γ channels (darker gray). A scale bar at the bottom indicates a length of 2 μm.
