Caption: Fig. 3.70. Dislocation microstructure in the AM1 single-crystal superalloy deformed at 950 °C with Δεtotal = 1.27% and with R = 0 [70]. P is the projection of the loading axis. Dislocations are localised at {001} interfaces, see arrows marked 1; {010} and {100} channels, see arrows marked 2, are free of dislocations.
Description: A TEM image of the dislocation microstructure in an AM1 superalloy. It shows dislocations concentrated at the γ/γ' interfaces (indicated by arrows '1'), while the γ channels (arrows '2') are relatively free of dislocations. Annotations include 'g=022' and a '500 nm' scale bar.
